OL,3,A'We cannot show our grandson photos of
OL,4,Ahis dad after wildfire destroyed our
OL,5,Ahouse'
OL,6,
OL,7,FTreasured photos of family members,
OL,8,Fdestroyed forever - those are among the
OL,9,Fkey possessions which Sandy and Uttam
OL,10,FShiralkar say they will never hold
OL,11,Fagain.
OL,13,FThey were among the 19 families who
OL,14,Flost their homes when two fires started
OL,15,Faccidentally and tore through dry grass
OL,16,Fand into their estate in Stourbridge,
OL,17,Fin the West Midlands, on the hottest
OL,18,Fday of the year.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
