OL,3,A'We cannot show our grandson photos of
OL,4,Ahis dad after wildfire destroyed our
OL,5,Ahouse'
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We have lost 20, 30 years of memories.
OL,8,FThey may be there in the mind but you
OL,9,Fcan't share them with others," Uttam
OL,10,Fadmitted.
OL,12,FHe was working from home on 13 August
OL,13,Fwhen he first noticed the smell of
OL,14,Fsmoke, at first thinking someone was
OL,15,Fhaving a barbecue.
